<title>NEW ZEALAND: SBS cuts NZ variable mortgage rate to 8.95 pct.</title>
<headline>SBS cuts NZ variable mortgage rate to 8.95 pct.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Southland Building Society on Wednesday said it would cut its New Zealand variable home mortgage rate to 8.95 percent from 9.75 percent, effective May 1 for new customers and June 23 for existing customers.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom 64 4 4734746</p>
</text>
